/**
 * Public surface of the calculated-field DSL — the `calc` namespace.
 *
 * Covers the public Knowhere calculated-expression grammar: arithmetic and
 * comparisons; logical/conditional functions; aggregate functions; date,
 * text, regex, JSON, and numeric functions; literals; and field projections.
 * Automation workflow parameters layer on in
 * `automation/calculation-expression.ts` because they are not calculated-field
 * concepts.
 *
 * Operator naming: `plus` / `minus` / `times` / `dividedBy` instead of
 * `add` / `subtract` / `multiply` / `divide` so the resulting code
 * reads close to the math expression. Same shape as the Java
 * `ExpressionUtil.addition` / `subtraction` / etc. helpers.
 */
